# General

Standard: every task and project has a home. The catch-all Area for whatever no other Area fits ([[gtd]], Clarify).

## Projects

```dataview
TABLE status, due, priority
FROM "Projects"
WHERE contains(area, this.file.link)
SORT status ASC
```

## Tasks

```dataview
TABLE status, due
FROM "Tasks"
WHERE contains(area, this.file.link) AND status != "done" AND status != "cancelled"
SORT due ASC
```

